DECLARE `s 486.4(1) offence charged` HAS
    `the provision of the Code the offence is charged under` IS A `Provision of the Code`
    `the offence is an offence under this Act as it read from time to time before the day on which subparagraph (a)(ii) comes into force` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the conduct alleged would be an offence referred to in subparagraph (a)(i) if it occurred on or after that day` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:8882 | (a) any of the following offences:
-- src:8883 | (i) an offence under section 151, 152, 153, 153.1, 155, 160, 162, 162.1, 163.1, 170, 171, 171.1, 172, 172.1, 172.2, 173, 213, 271, 272, 273, 279.01, 279.011, 279.02, 279.03, 280, 281, 286.1, 286.2, 286.3, 346 or 347, or
-- src:8884 | (ii) any offence under this Act, as it read from time to time before the day on which this subparagraph comes into force, if the conduct alleged would be an offence referred to in subparagraph (i) if it occurred on or after that day; or
@ref s 486.4(1)(a) (src:8882-8884)
