    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in proceedings in respect of an offence other than an offence referred to in subsection (1), if the victim is under the age of 18 years"

-- 486.4(2.2) In proceedings in respect of an offence other than ..., if the victim is under the age of 18 years, the presiding judge or justice shall (a) as soon as feasible, inform the victim of their right to make an application;
